        <section id="about-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>About Me</h2>

                <p>I started programming very early in life. My first programming text hails from 1994, from when I was just five years old. Despite my early proclivities, I'd like to say that I'm not solely defined by my capacity as a programming ninja. I also have a lot of super-awesome hobbies, enough in fact that I often don't have time for all of them.</p>
                <p>Learning is important to me. It has to be in such a fast-moving industry. I endeavour to learn at least one new thing every day. Now not all of this information is useful. In fact, I assimilate a great deal of less-than-useful information. For example, did you know that according to a 2003 study at the University of Illinois, women are more likely than men to eat food off of a floor, which is important only when one understands that 93% of the population's footwear hosts fecal bacteria. While not entirely useless, this tidbit of information really only tells us that we should stop wearing our shoes indoors and avoid the five-second rule.</p>

                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary shape circle shape-lg">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-user"></span>
                    </a>
                    <h3>Resume</h3>
                    <p>Learn more about my qualifications. Lots of things aren't included in my resume, so if you think I'm missing something you might need, why not <a href="">ask me first?</a> Just to make sure.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary shape circle shape-lg">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-folder-open"></span>
                    </a>
                    <h3>Portfolio</h3>
                    <p>See some of the things I've worked on. NDAs prohibit me from exhibiting some of my work, but you'll still find a good deal of interesting stuff.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary shape circle shape-lg">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-picture"></span>
                    </a>
                    <h3>Gallery</h3>
                    <p>I like covering a wide variety of subjects. Water, boats on the water, debris in the water, birds, birds in the water, and clouds made of water feature heavily. Enjoy!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary shape circle shape-lg">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-list-alt"></span>
                    </a>
                    <h3>Blog</h3>
                    <p>I enjoy covering technical, business, life, and spirituality. Pick your desired read.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
